text.section:
All course participants shall be required to wear the following protective gear during on-cycle instruction:

A motorcycle helmet that meets the requirements of § 46.2-910;


Eye protection;


A pair of boots or shoes that cover and protect the ankles and feet;


A long sleeved jacket or long sleeved shirt and long pants of denim or other material of equivalent durability; and


A pair of full-fingered gloves of leather or other material with resistance to abrasion.
